    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Adds a Question" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add a Question</p>
            <p>Verifies that a new question can be added with valid details including category, client type, capacities, and risk points.</p>
            <step>1. Navigate to Questions settings. 2. Click "Add" and fill in all required question details. 3. Save the question.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• The question should be successfully added.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
